Ability:
At the start of Action Time,
if this Character has vibe 6 or greater,
boost its vibe by 6 for the rest of this Cycle.

When this Character enters the huddle,
if you have no cards in your deck,
you win the game.

At the start of Action Time,
if your huddle contains a Character of each color,
draw a card.

Whenever you get Fishsicles
from anything non-Silly,
you get an additional Fishsicle.

Whenever this Character becomes unflopped,
if it's not at the Unfloppening,
choose a Character and flop it.
